OL,3,APope warns against 'losing humanity' to
OL,4,AAI machines
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn his May appeal, he mentioned the
OL,7,Fslave trade in relation to AI,
OL,8,Fsuggesting that the world was in danger
OL,9,Fof normalising the exploitation of
OL,10,Fpeople once again.
